<title>USA: Biovail, Elan settle patent litigation.</title>
<headline>Biovail, Elan settle patent litigation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biovail Corp International said Monday it had settled all patent litigation with Elan Corp Plc.</p>
<p>Elan has alleged infringement of its diltiazem patents by Biovail.</p>
<p>Diltiazem is used to treat angina pectoris and hypertension.</p>
<p>The settlement releases all claims for the patents at issue, including Biovail's licensed patent for verapamil, also used to treat hypertension.</p>
<p>Biovail said it and Elan have agreed to various cross-royalty payments on certain current and future diltiazem and verapamil products.</p>
</text>
